  "ruleText": "He-W 512.09 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before claims shall be submitted to the department’s fiscal agent in accordance with 42 CFR 433.139.\n\nSource. #11012, INTERIM, eff 1-1-16, EXPIRES: 6-29-16 (from He-W 512.07); ss by #11119, eff 6-29-16",
